          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "முற்றம் — muṟṟam — \"a courtyard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பாட்டியின் வீட்டில் நடுவில் ஒரு பெரிய முற்றம் இருக்கிறது. pāṭṭiyiṉ vīṭṭil naṭuvil oru periya muṟṟam irukkiṟatu. Grandmother's house has a big courtyard in the middle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An open yard inside a house, under the sky. As a -அம் noun: முற்றத்தில்."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "முற்றம் (muṟṟam) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5016 gives முற்றம் (muṟṟam), \"the courtyard of a house, an open space\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
